{"id":"341dbc6a97001587","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-incomparable-degrees.md","title":"Incomparable Degrees","display":"df-incomparable-degrees — Incomparable Degrees","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-incomparable-degrees","aliases":["68-df-incomparable-degrees"],"display":"df-incomparable-degrees — Incomparable Degrees","depends_on":["[[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§15 propositions 15.2 and 15.5 pp.54,57 / PDF 63,66","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"not-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-incomparable-degrees"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-incomparable-degrees</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-incomparable-degrees — Incomparable Degrees"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"52c2209f400df1a9\" href=\"?note=52c2209f400df1a9\" title=\"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees\">68-df-partial-order-on-degrees</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§15 propositions 15.2 and 15.5 pp.54,57 / PDF 63,66"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span>，度序见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"52c2209f400df1a9\" href=\"?note=52c2209f400df1a9\" title=\"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees\">68-df-partial-order-on-degrees</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mid\">\\(\\mid\\)</span> 为以下二元谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a\\mid\\mathbf b\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg(\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf b)\\land\\neg(\\mathbf b\\le\\mathbf a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf a\\mid\\mathbf b\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg(\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf b)\\land\\neg(\\mathbf b\\le\\mathbf a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>不可比排除两个非严格方向，特别排除相等。原书 Kleene–Post 命题及 Friedberg–Muchnik 命题使用此条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees","status":"resolved","id":"52c2209f400df1a9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees","status":"resolved","id":"52c2209f400df1a9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D$，度序见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]。$\\mid$ 为以下二元谓词。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mid","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf a\\mid\\mathbf b\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg(\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf b)\\land\\neg(\\mathbf b\\le\\mathbf a).","display":true}],"bytes":958,"backlinks":[{"id":"0cca9651cac638c4","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RE}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]，$\\mathrm{REDeg}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]，$\\mid$ 见 [[68-df-incomparable-degrees]]，$\\le_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-reducibility]]。集合构造与稳定性论证见 [[68-thm-friedberg-muchnik-construction]]。"},{"id":"7eb62978269b937a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal D$ 见 [[68-df-turing-degree]]，$\\mid$ 见 [[68-df-incomparable-degrees]]。"},{"id":"d10c661122833e3a","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{REDeg}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]，度序与 $\\mathbf0,\\mathbf0'$ 见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]] 的上游；度 join 见 [[68-df-degree-join]]；不可比性见 [[68-df-incomparable-degrees]]。稠密性部分依赖尚待来源核验的 [[68-thm-re-degree-density]]。"},{"id":"22650f6ea4564962","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{REDeg}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]，$\\mathrm{Split}(\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c,\\mathbf a)$ 见 [[68-df-degree-splitting]]，$\\mid$ 见 [[68-df-incomparable-degrees]]，严格度序及零度由这些定义的上游给定。"},{"id":"3c3856e6a89f9c9b","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{REDeg}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]，$\\mathrm{Split}(\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c,\\mathbf a)$ 见 [[68-df-degree-splitting]]，$\\mid$ 见 [[68-df-incomparable-degrees]]，严格度序及零度由这些定义的上游给定。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-incomparable-degrees]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-incomparable-degrees]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-82","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-incomparable-degrees|df-incomparable-degrees — Incomparable Degrees]]"}],"outgoing":["52c2209f400df1a9"]}